      "en": "CONSTRUCTIONAL ELEMENTS IN GENERAL; STRUCTURES BUILT-UP FROM SUCH ELEMENTS, IN GENERAL<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This subclass does not cover similar elements and structures, restricted to use in the building art, which are covered by subclass E04C.<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br><br>In this subclass non-limiting references (in the sense of paragraph 39 of the Guide to the IPC) may still be displayed in the scheme.",
