      "level": 8,
      "parent": "F01D1/00",
      "ja": "定置状の作動流体案内手段とブレードまたは同様のロータをもつもの，｛例．多数ブレード衝動蒸気タービン｝（Ｆ０１Ｄ１／２４が優先；定置状の作動流体案内手段をもたないものＦ０１Ｄ１／１８）",
      "en": "with stationary working-fluid guiding means and bladed or like rotor, {e.g. multi-bladed impulse steam turbines}(F01D1/24 takes precedence; without stationary working-fluid guiding means F01D1/18)",
