      "code": "F02D3/02",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "F02D3/00",
      "ja": "連続的な噴射または噴射ノズル上流での連続的な流れを有するもの",
      "en": "with continuous injection or continuous flow upstream of the injection nozzle",
      "count": 96,
      "ipcCode": "F02D3/02",
      "coreCode": "F02D3/02",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_F02D.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
