      "en": "Controlling engines by throttling air or fuel-and-air induction conduits or exhaust conduits<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> - in this group the following indexing codes are used: F02D2700/00, F02D2700/02, F02D2700/04, <br>F02D2700/09",
