      "code": "F02M63/0001",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "F02M63/00",
      "ja": "｛特別に配設された潤滑系統をもつ燃料噴射装置，例．重油によるもの（機関の潤滑Ｆ０１Ｍ）｝",
      "en": "{Fuel-injection apparatus with specially arranged lubricating system, e.g. by fuel oil (lubrication of engines F01M)}",
