      "level": 8,
      "parent": "F15C1/00",
      "ja": "渦流形装置，すなわち流弁中の渦運動に伴う圧力降下が作られるための装置｛（渦流室Ｆ１５Ｄ１／００１５；抵抗としての渦流室Ｆ１５Ｃ１／０２；相互作用により切換時間を改善できる増幅器と関連する渦流室Ｆ１５Ｃ１／１４）｝",
      "en": "Vortex devices, i.e. devices in which use is made of the pressure drop associated with vortex motion in a fluid {(vortex chambers F15D1/0015; vortex chambers as resistances F15C1/02; vortex chambers associated with amplifiers for improving the switching time by interaction F15C1/14)}",
