      "code": "F24F2003/003",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "F24F3/00",
      "ja": "｛中央装置における１次空気処理および部屋内または部屋の近辺に位置する空気処理ユニットにおける，それに続く２次空気処理を有するもの｝",
      "en": "{with primary air treatment in the central station and subsequent secondary air treatment in air treatment units located in or near the rooms}",
      "count": 58,
      "ipcCode": "F24F3/00",
      "coreCode": "F24F3/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_F24F.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
