      "ja": "｛スクレーパーを備える固定床を持つもの（Ｆ２６Ｂ１７／００６，Ｆ２６Ｂ１７／００７が優先）｝",
      "en": "{with fixed floors provided with scrapers (F26B17/006 and F26B17/007 take precedence)}",
      "count": 379,
      "ipcCode": "F26B17/00",
      "coreCode": "F26B17/00",
      "note": "",
