      "level": 9,
      "parent": "F26B17/10",
      "ja": "｛乾燥密閉体が１つまたは複数のシャフトまたはダクト形状を有するもの，例．実質的に直線及び垂直軸をもつもの（Ｆ２６Ｂ１７／１０７が優先）｝",
      "en": "{the drying enclosure having the shape of one or a plurality of shafts or ducts, e.g. with substantially straight and vertical axis (F26B17/107 takes precedence)}",
